Output "../assets/creation-raw.mp4"
Output "../assets/creation-terminal.txt"
Source tapes/settings.tape

Hide
Type "copilot --experimental --disable-builtin-mcps --allow-all-tools --no-remote"
Enter
Sleep 10s
Show
Sleep 1s
Screenshot "../assets/creation-open.png"
Set TypingSpeed 24ms
Type "Create book-release-check as a reusable project dynamic workflow extension: run pytest and CLI help; pause for my review; ask an agent for two untested behaviors; save release-report.md. Journal checks so resume does not rerun them. Do not run it yet."
Sleep 2s
Screenshot "../assets/creation-prompt.png"
Enter
Sleep 180s
Screenshot "../assets/creation-result.png"
Ctrl+C
Sleep 500ms
Ctrl+C
Sleep 1s
